  "prefLabel": "Lab 211.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 211.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide uniform procedures for the conduct of public comment hearings held pursuant to RSA 541-A:11.\n\nSource. #8922-A, eff 7-1-07; ss by #14534, eff 3-12-26 (formerly Lab 210.01)",
